<title>MEXICO: Invermexico holders approve takeover.</title>
<headline>Invermexico holders approve takeover.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Grupo Financiero Invermexico SA said on Wednesday its shareholders had approved the takeover of the company by Spain's Banco Santander SA.</p>
<p>&quot;The Group and its subsidiaries are to be merged with a Mexican affiliate of Banco Santander SA (i.e. Grupo Financiero Santander Mexico) and its subsidiaries within a period not to exceed approximately one year,&quot; the group said in a statement.</p>
</text>
